%N A402259 Decimal expansion of the asymptotic mean of A037445(k)/A000005(k), the ratio between the number of infinitary divisors and the number of divisors over the positive integers.
%C A402259 The ratio A037445(k)/A000005(k) equals 1 (its maximum value) for numbers k in A036537. It can be arbitrarily small, with record low values attained at values of k listed in A335832.
%F A402259 Equals lim_{m->oo} (1/m) * Sum_{k=1..m} A037445(k)/A000005(k).
%F A402259 Equals Product_{p prime} ((1-1/p) * Sum_{k>=0} 2^A000120(k) / ((k+1) * p^k)).
%e A402259 0.875242426145600844199016001013113884414728637832256...
%o A402259 (PARI) c(kmax) = prodeulerrat((1-1/p) * sum(k = 0, kmax, 2^hammingweight(k) / ((k+1) * p^k)));
%o A402259 {my(c1 = 0, c2 = 1, m = 1); while(c2 != c1, c1 = c2; c2 = c(m); m++); c2}
%Y A402259 Cf. A000005, A000120, A036537, A037445, A335832.
%Y A402259 Similar constants: A308043, A361060, A402258.
%K A402259 nonn,cons,new
%O A402259 0,1
